  "0_outline_root": "ROOT: Custom Column Handling > Requirements",
  "0_outline_lines": [
    "L020: \"Column conforming to CustomColumnHandling attribute MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L022: \"*Custom column* MUST adhere to the following Column ID naming requirements:\"",
    "    L023: \"*Custom column* MUST include the `x_` prefix in the Column ID to identify it as an external *custom column* and to distinguish it from *FOCUS columns* to avoid conflicts in future releases.\"",
    "    L024: \"*Custom column* SHOULD use [*Pascal case*](#glossary:pascalcase) in the portion of the Column ID following the required `x_` prefix.\"",
    "    L025: \"*Custom column* SHOULD use only alphanumeric characters in the portion of the Column ID following the required `x_` prefix.\"",
    "    L026: \"*Custom column* SHOULD NOT include special characters other than the underscore in the required `x_` prefix.\"",
    "    L028: \"*Custom column* SHOULD NOT use abbreviations other than `Id` in the Column ID.\"",
    "    L029: \"*Custom column* SHOULD NOT use acronyms other than `Sku` in the Column ID.\"",
    "    L030: \"*Custom column* SHOULD NOT exceed 50 characters in the Column ID to accommodate column length restrictions of various data repositories.\"",
    "    L031: \"*Custom column* SHOULD include the `Id` suffix in the Column ID when the *custom column* represents an identifier.\"",
    "    L032: \"*Custom column* SHOULD include the `Name` suffix in the Column ID when the *custom column* represents a name.\"",
    "  L033: \"*Custom column* SHOULD conform to [DataGeneratorCalculatedSplitCostAllocationHandling](#attributes.datagenerator-calculatedsplitcostallocationhandling) requirements when the data generator supports data generator-calculated split cost allocation.\"",
    "  L034: \"*Custom column* SHOULD conform to [NullHandling](#attributes.nullhandling) requirements.\"",
    "  L035: \"*Custom column* containing date/time values SHOULD conform to [DateTimeFormat](#attributes.date/timeformat) requirements.\"",
    "  L036: \"*Custom column* containing JSON objects MUST have its object schema documented by the data generator and accessible to practitioners.\"",
    "  L037: \"*Custom column* containing numeric values MUST contain a single numeric value.\"",
    "  L038: \"*Custom column* containing numeric values SHOULD conform to [NumericFormat](#attributes.numericformat) requirements.\"",
    "  L039: \"*Custom column* containing string values SHOULD conform to [StringHandling](#attributes.stringhandling) requirements.\"",
    "  L040: \"*Custom column* representing a national currency SHOULD conform to [CurrencyFormat](#attributes.currencyformat) requirements.\"",
    "  L041: \"*Custom column* representing a measurement unit SHOULD conform to [UnitFormat](#attributes.unitformat) requirements.\""
  ],
